cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below (see preferred-citation)."
type: software
title: "ScrambleMix: official PyTorch implementation"
abstract: >-
  Official PyTorch implementation of ScrambleMix, a privacy-preserving image processing for
  edge-cloud machine learning (PSIVT 2023): two copies of an image are scrambled with the two keys
  of a key pair and mixed with a random ratio; a classifier is trained on several such views with a
  self-teaching loss and averages predictions over several keys at test time.
